  "text": "Skip to content\nCareers\nOpen roles\nPortfolios\nReferrals\nAbout\nLogin\nHire with 8x\nFind your role\nExplore careers\nat 8x.\n\nRoles at 8x and companies we partner with.\n\nJoin the team\nJoin the platform\n\nRoles at 8x and at the companies we partner with. You apply on this site, and the role’s practical assignment is issued the moment you submit.\n\n16 open roles\n\nAll roles\nEngineering\nDesign\nMarketing & creative\nOperations\nVideo Editor\n\nTurn footage into videos people actually watch.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nSan Francisco or remote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nGraphic Designer\n\nDesign everything 8x puts its name on, from creator merch drops to the ads that sell them. Merch, play launches and paid creative across four products and ten markets. You are the first dedicated designer, so the taste and the output are yours.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nRemote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nPaid Ads Manager\n\nOwn every paid channel at 8x, across four products and ten markets. Google, Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn and ChatGPT Ads, pointed at creator recruitment, B2B demand and new product launches. Small budgets on purpose: the job is finding what works before anyone spends real money. Hands in the account, not managing an agency.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nRemote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nSoftware Engineer\n\nOwn a full product end to end.\n\nField:\nEngineering\nLocation:\nSan Francisco or remote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nGlobal Sales Intern - 8x LinkedIn (US & EU)\n\nLead 8x LinkedIn's sales in the US and EU. You write the go-to-market playbook, build your own outreach, close the first clients and grow them into long-term partners. Fully remote, no CV requirements. Show us you are hungry and can execute.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nRemote (US & EU)\nEmployment type:\nInternship (2 week trial)\nGrowth Engineer (LATAM)\n\nGrowth Engineer based in LATAM who owns UGC and influencer marketing campaigns start to finish: sourcing and onboarding creators, running content production, and tracking performance.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nLATAM\nMarket Lead Intern - Southeast Asia\n\nAn internship for university students in Southeast Asia. Lead 8x's launch in your market (Singapore, Malaysia, Thailand, the Philippines or Indonesia): write the go-to-market playbook, build your own outreach, close the first local clients and grow them into long-term partners. Fully remote, native-level in your market, no CV requirements. Show us you are hungry and can execute.\n\nField:\nDesign\nLocation:\nRemote (Southeast Asia)\nEmployment type:\nInternship (2 week trial)\nMarket Lead Intern - Portugal & Brazil\n\nAn internship for university students or recent graduates in Portugal or Brazil. Lead 8x's launch in your market: write the go-to-market playbook, build your own outreach, close the first local clients and grow them into long-term partners. Fully remote, native Portuguese, no CV requirements. Show us you are hungry and can execute.\n\nField:\nDesign\nLocation:\nRemote (Portugal or Brazil)\nEmployment type:\nInternship (2 week trial)\nMarket Lead Intern - Japan\n\nAn internship for university students in Japan. Lead 8x's launch in the Japanese market: write the go-to-market playbook, build your own outreach, close the first Japanese clients and grow them into long-term partners. Fully remote, native Japanese, no CV requirements. Show us you are hungry and can execute.\n\nField:\nDesign\nLocation:\nRemote (Japan)\nEmployment type:\nInternship (2 week trial)\nMarket Lead Intern - Poland\n\nAn internship for university students in Poland. Lead 8x's launch in the Polish market: write the go-to-market playbook, build your own outreach, close the first Polish clients and grow them into long-term partners. Fully remote, native Polish, no CV requirements. Show us you are hungry and can execute.\n\nField:\nDesign\nLocation:\nRemote (Poland)\nEmployment type:\nInternship (2 week trial)\nCreator Partnerships & Campaigns Manager\n\nOwn LinkedIn creator campaigns end-to-end, managing both clients and creators to make sure every campaign runs smoothly from brief to post.\n\nField:\nOperations\nHiring Manager\n\nManage the hiring process at 8x careers\n\nField:\nOperations\nLocation:\nRemote\nBuilder in Residence at 8x\n\nOne role. One person. A blank page and the biggest brands in the world.\n\nField:\nOperations\nLocation:\nRemote\nProduct Designer\n\nDesign every product we ship.\n\nField:\nDesign\nLocation:\nSan Francisco or remote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nIntrapreneur\n\nLead a project from research to revenue.\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nSan Francisco or remote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\n8x Brand\n\nElevate the 8x brand, on social and in the room\n\nField:\nMarketing & creative\nLocation:\nSan Francisco or remote\nEmployment type:\nFull-time\nFind a role\nand send us your work.\nFind your role\nOpen roles\nPortfolios\nReferrals\nAbout 8x\n\nRemote-first,\nbuilt from San Francisco.\n\n8x Careers\nBack to the beginning"
